+- Drop the unused Herdr `UnixListener` fixture from tests/seat_exit_codes.rs and tests/daemon_error_commands.rs, or point `HERDR_SOCKET_PATH` at it where a reachable Herdr is intended.
+- Replace the near-vacuous `contains("s")` stdout assertion in tests/node_manager_warning.rs with a check for the seat name line.
+- Deduplicate the git2 `commit`/`seat_files` helpers between tests/node_manager_warning.rs and src/cli/node_manager_warning.rs unit tests (task-14 deferred minor).
